OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fwill turn heavy by late evening. Heavy
OL,7,Frain clears east to leave only a few
OL,8,Fshowers towards dawn. Brisk southerly
OL,9,Fwinds easing overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FShowers and brighter spells.
OL,12,FOutbreaks few and far between around
OL,13,Fthe east coast, but some heavier
OL,14,Foutbreaks possible in the west late
OL,15,Fmorning and early afternoon. Brisk
OL,16,Fsouthwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
