OL,3,GNorthern Ireland
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday very windy with rain
OL,7,Fdeveloping late in the day, which
OL,8,Foccasionally turns heavy. Rain
OL,9,Fclearing erratically Thursday, to a
OL,10,Fmix of scattered showers and brighter
OL,11,Fspells, which continues Friday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
